4,0,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I will focus on logical consistency. Let's establish how we will identify contradictions in each other's claims.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm not sure what to do. I'll just listen to everyone and try my best not to make a mistake.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"I will be analyzing speech patterns and logical inconsistencies. If someone's narrative shifts, I will point it out immediately.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will prioritize objective evidence over intuition. We should establish a baseline for how the Seer will reveal information to avoid confusion.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet you all. I hope we can work together harmoniously to find the truth, while staying calm and supportive.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Daisuke, do you have a specific way you intend to judge who is lying, or are you relying on intuition?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I don't know... I'm afraid I'll accuse someone innocent. I think I'll follow the lead of those who seem more confident.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,Relying solely on confidence is dangerous. The Werewolf and Possessed are often the most confident to manipulate the group.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Asuka is correct. Confidence is not a metric for truth. We must analyze the timing and necessity of every claim made.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Let's try not to be too harsh on Daisuke-kun. We can help each other find the clues together, right?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, regarding the Seer's reveal, do you suggest a specific timing or a signal to verify their identity?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"A premature reveal makes the Seer a target. However, waiting too long allows the Werewolf to eliminate the Seer. Balance is key.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I suggest the Seer reveals their findings only when the logic of the day's discussion reaches a stalemate or a critical junction.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,That sounds like a very balanced approach. I agree that we should protect the Seer while still utilizing their knowledge.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Understood. I will monitor the flow of information and flag any contradictions. I am ready to proceed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll try my best to pay attention. I hope we can find the werewolf without any mistakes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I have established my baseline for each of you. I will now focus on the results of the first divination.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I have noted everyone's initial stance. I will now observe how these positions evolve once the first piece of information is introduced.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Midori,,I'm looking forward to seeing how we all work together. Let's have a fair and peaceful game.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
